iment with your equipment.\nFight your way through plenty of types of enemies.\nMeet all kinds of strange and weird characters.\nDiscover the lore and learn about its world.\nSolve puzzles and overcome obstacles.\nExplore different areas and collect items.", "summary": "Welcome to 'The Factory': a horror experience where you, to put it simply, are the badass hero. You explore an abandoned factory to find some valuables in the shoes of Dovydas Pjurka, a simple and poor Lithuanian man from Rainiai who will do anything to survive and pay his overdue bills. There are 15 chapters in total, and they are filled with abandoned environments, exploration, combat, puzzles, strange encounters, and plenty of things to discover.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-factory", "videos": [{"id": 202671, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ayQuIxai5lg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ayQuIxai5lg", "title": "The Factory Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ayQuIxai5lg/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 203507, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "aQ2ZimwF8c0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aQ2ZimwF8c0", "title": "The Factory Official Teaser 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aQ2ZimwF8c0/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 203508, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Zn3xf-I7a9o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zn3xf-I7a9o", "title": "The Factory Official Trailer 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zn3xf-I7a9o/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 63917, "region": {"id": 4, "name": "Europe", "category": "continent", "identifier": "EU"}}]}